          "scope": {
            "session": "s_02long"
          },
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "SAML single sign-on is included in the Business plan and works with Okta [help:sso@8#0]. To set it up:\n1. As a workspace owner, open Settings, then Security, then Single sign-on, and copy Fernway's ACS URL and entity ID.\n2. In Okta, create a new SAML app and paste those values into it.\n3. Paste Okta's metadata URL back into Fernway and choose Test connection [help:sso@8#1].\nBefore you enforce SSO, verify your email domain as well [help:sso@8#2]."
        },
        {
          "token_budget": null,
          "variants": [],
          "conflict_policy": "defers",
          "eligibility": "route-policy",
          "id": "turn:s_02long:0003",
