          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "Open Settings, then Domains, and add the TXT record Fernway shows you to your DNS. Only members whose email address is on a verified domain can sign in with SSO [help:sso@8#2]. The articles don't say how long verification takes; that depends on how quickly your DNS change is published."
